營業時間不定，打卡前建議電話聯繫店鋪是否營業，附近停車不便，建議綠色出行。</p><p>3. 4家推薦小店剛入選米芝蓮必比登不久，店裏可能會比較忙，高峰期需要排隊，建議大家避開繁忙時間前往。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/997191208755269632268539.jpeg/tDP8Uu6x0VUWIeCAuwrEc5xeSmZNz4XmSfzZVUn82VU\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.015800+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2745,"images":31,"source":"HK01 深圳","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:05:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:14:52.798360+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.242613+00:00","content_hash":"7563cda212d8ba63f73fc26b3efcfeb33f98099def9b24f748d56fbaf34979c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}